   "source": ["# Pix2Pix: Sketch → Photo\n", "**COMP 484 | Kathmandu University**\n\n", "Conditional GAN trained on Edges2Shoes dataset.\n", "Architecture: U-Net generator + PatchGAN discriminator.\n\n", "Run cells in order. Model checkpoints and generated images save to Google Drive."]
